    "greetings": "💡 <em>Hola</em> works everywhere. Spaniards are warm — a smile and an attempt at Spanish goes a very long way.",
    "food": "💡 Lunch (2–4pm) is the main meal. Dinner rarely starts before 9pm. Many kitchens close between 4–8pm.",
