    "emergency": "💡 Emergency: <strong>112</strong> (all services). Tourist police in Barcelona: <strong>092</strong>.",
    "shopping": "Say hola when you walk in. Small shops may close in the afternoon.",
    "medical": "Call 112. A pharmacy door lists the nearest one open overnight.",
    "immigration": "Schengen rules apply. Have a return ticket and the hotel address.",
    "hotel": "Afternoon closing is real. Ask for the Wi-Fi password at check-in.",
    "transport": "Validate a metro ticket. In Barcelona, keep your bag in front of you."
