  "pronGuide": {
    "title": "Spanish Sounds",
    "tips": [
      "In Spain, C before E/I = \"th\" — Barcelona = Bar-theh-LO-nah",
      "V and B sound almost identical in Spanish",
      "Stress the second-to-last syllable in most words",
      "LL and Y both sound like \"y\" (as in yes) in most of Spain"
    ]
